		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 43dea2c1-a6c2-42f2-b080-91e8eb4918ea</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Accessibility</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::11:51:20</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::11:51:20</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The SMSWTD shall be able to provide warnings compatible with assistive technologies like screen readers and braille devices.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">NF1</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 197f1d89-a4a4-43d6-bb1c-d07b45436e49</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Availability</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::12:0:52</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::12:0:52</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\fs20 The SMSWTD shall operate 24/7, achieave an uptime of 99.9%25 and handle surges in alert traffic during disaster events.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">NF2</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 71c847d1-3978-4dd6-b09f-b47650b3a03f</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Performance</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::11:59:23</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::11:59:23</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\fs20 The SMSWTD shall maintain a response time of less than 1 second for high-priority alerts.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">NF3</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID eda2cad5-bb92-4917-a88c-8b1c8cfb3a43</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Security</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::11:57:16</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::11:57:16</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\fs20 The SMSWTD shall be encrypted during transmission to ensure data integrity and prevent unauthorized access.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">NF5</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 6119326a-5b84-4bd2-a8ff-14f2d7591eaa</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Timeliness</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::11:57:38</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::11:57:38</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\fs20 The SMSWTD shall be able to send alerts via multiple channels within 10 seconds of issuance.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">NF6</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID d344ec51-3926-4c48-b931-1f4392e09c8f</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Usability</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.29.2024::12:28:52</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">12.29.2024::12:28:52</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\fs20 The system interface shall be easy to use for the operators to configure the communication channels.\par%0D
\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
			<reqID type="a">NF7</reqID>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID c337c500-c9f7-4c03-ae84-9d9b1faed0c1</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Scalability</_name>
